@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "SAFR002: Generate Client Alerts Based on Predefined Conditions" as SAFR002
  usecase "SFR013: Generate Client Analytics" as SFR013
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Client Predictive Intervention Recommendations" as AIFR009

  client --> CFR001 : View financial data in a comprehensive format.
  client --> FAFR002 : Receive alerts about potential fraud or unusual spending patterns.
  client --> CFR003 : Access future financial trends and make informed decisions.
  client --> CFR004 : Get personalized investment advice aligned with goals.
  client --> CFR005 : Adjust preferences for recommendations to match risk tolerance.
  client --> SAFR002 : Manage system-generated alerts based on user settings.
  client --> SFR013 : Review financial performance metrics and trends.

  sysadmin --> SAFR001 : Configure analysis parameters ensuring regulatory compliance (Basel III).
  
  advisor --> FAFR002 : Monitor clients for proactive assistance via system alerts.
  advisor --> AIFR009 : Receive recommendations to engage with clients at critical times.
}

@enduml